@Inquiry_HostAddress = http://localhost:5115

### 1. Simple Login (Admin)
POST {{Inquiry_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@bahaylink.ph",
  "password": "Admin123.",
  "rememberMe": true
}

###

### 2. Register New Renter
POST {{Inquiry_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Dela Cruz",
  "email": "juan.renter@example.com",
  "phone": "09123456789",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 3. Logout
POST {{Inquiry_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Get All Users
GET {{Inquiry_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Get User By ID
GET {{Inquiry_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json
